  "transcription_note": "All three grids read from the p099/p104/p118 page images (U-30 resolved by image): Rockerboy 'Heavy Melee Weapon or Flashbang Grenade' is one choice line; Rockerboy prints 'Jewelry x3' on the Jewelry piece in its Generic Chic line (not on Jacket); Medtech prints Handcuffs; the Exec outfit prints NO Agent (a printed omission, not an extraction drop). Printed Humanity Loss sums and '(-N EMP)' strings are stored as printed; D-6: Media and Lawman print '10 Humanity Loss (-2 EMP)', which conflicts with the Humanity rule (losing 10 from a multiple of 10 lowers EMP by exactly 1): the string is kept as printed in `printed_emp_change` and the engine computes EMP from Humanity (the sheet never prints this string). Fashion lines carry `fashion_style` and `pieces`; plain lines carry `options`.",
  "kind": "starting_kit"
